p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Enemy Waves</strong>: Defend against<strong> ground</strong>,<strong> naval</strong>, and<strong> airborne</strong>\u00a0enemies and bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Player Abilities</strong>: Call in<strong> airstrikes</strong>, deploy protective<strong> bubble shields</strong>, and even manipulate the battlefield with <strong>lightning storms</strong> and <strong>blizzards</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>War Across 27 Regions</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight your way through<strong> forests</strong>,<strong> deserts</strong>,<strong> snowy mountains</strong>,<strong> </strong>and<strong> warn-torn cities</strong>\u00a0as you defend key locations across the realm. Each region presents new challenges, tougher enemy forces, and evolving battlefield conditions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story-Driven Campaign</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a dynamic\u00a0<strong>military conflict with a progressing storyline</strong>, featuring four key characters who guide you through the campaign with tactical insights and battlefield banter. The war isn't just about survival - it's about stopping the enemy commander before he unlocks the power of the<strong> Empyreal Core</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can you defend the realm and prevent its secrets from falling into enemy hands?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Nighthawk Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575690/b52f74e65052850af1300027e2601fd2ab1cb588/header.jpg?t=1768836292","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommend